, by supplying electricity to the built-in heating elements. This allows wearers to feel warmth within seconds. That’s why the type of battery you use can significantly affect both heating performance and overall comfort.
<br><br>At Venustas, we use a variety of battery types across our <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/" target="_self"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">heated apparel</span></a> to optimize both warmth and wearability. In this guide, we’ll explore the battery technology behind our products to help you make an informed choice.
