d apparel, including heated jackets, heated vests, or heated hoodies, we use different types of batteries to provide power. The 5V battery pack is the first type used for our 5V heated apparel. To optimize the using experience, we upgraded our heated apparel to use a <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><u>7.4V battery</u></span></a>. From the year of 2023, we also release our <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></a><u><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></a></u><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><u>12V battery</u></span></a> to&nbsp;enhance the power output and heating performance. So, what’s the difference between these batteries? Our customers always want to know which battery is suitable for their individual needs, and they will find useful information in the following.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Venustas_Battery_Pack_Guide.png?v=1718783991" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Venustas_Battery_Pack_Guide.png?v=1718783991 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/Venustas_Battery_Pack_Guide_500x.png?v=1718783991 320w" width="720" height="480" alt="Venustas Battery Pack Guide.png__PID:5320110f-83ad-461e-b1fb-08a605c78ee2" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-BQMOd cJTQvv pf-57_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-58_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-59_"><p class="sc-zmgRN eaWHaV pf-60_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b></b><b>Voltage.</b>&nbsp;Voltage is the key difference in these battery packs. For heated apparel, higher voltage means more power for heating elements. The output capabilities rank as follows: 12V &gt; 7.4V &gt; 5V. The&nbsp;5V battery powers 3-4 heating elements, while the 7.4V and 12V batteries can power 5-6 elements. Additionally, 12V batteries significantly enhance heating performance, providing more efficient and faster heating.<br> </p><p class="sc-zmgRN eaWHaV pf-62_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Capacity.</strong>&nbsp;The battery capacity determines heating hours for heated apparel. The 7.4V batteries, with capacities of 4800mah&nbsp;offer 8-10 hours of warmth. For the 12V options, the <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><u>Venustas-7500 battery</u></span></a>&nbsp;provides up to 13 hours,&nbsp;and <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/venustas-7-4v-12v-battery-pack-10000mah" target="_self"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><u>Venustas-10000 battery </u></span></a>provides up to 20 hours.&nbsp;</p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/300-200_6a2d9360-9428-496e-8705-40250f620206.jpg?v=1718786075" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/300-200_6a2d9360-9428-496e-8705-40250f620206.jpg?v=1718786075 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/300-200_6a2d9360-9428-496e-8705-40250f620206_500x.jpg?v=1718786075 320w" width="720" height="480" alt="300-200.jpg__PID:08a605c7-8ee2-4a0f-9e20-9f6c84ced505" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-BQMOd cJTQvv pf-64_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-65_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-66_"><p class="sc-zmgRN eaWHaV pf-67_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b></b><b>Output.</b>&nbsp;To optimize the use of batteries, we upgraded our 7.4 batteries and 12 batteries with DC ports. Compared with USB port&nbsp;the DC port not only allows for a more robust power supply but also enhances better heating performance.<b> <br><br>Size.&nbsp;</b>Typically, the weight of the battery depends on the capacity and material. Our <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">Venustas-6000 battery</span></a><u><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></a></u><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></a>&nbsp;is smaller, lighter, and faster-charging, enhancing more portability and convenience during use. With its compact design, it easily fits into your pocket or bag, making it ideal for on-the-go lifestyles. .  <br> </p></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-69_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-70_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/compatibility_2835fbfe-8411-4ef9-aa6f-f477ae839db8.jpg?v=1718784912" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/compatibility_2835fbfe-8411-4ef9-aa6f-f477ae839db8.jpg?v=1718784912 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/compatibility_2835fbfe-8411-4ef9-aa6f-f477ae839db8_500x.jpg?v=1718784912 320w" width="720" height="480" alt="compatibility.jpg__PID:a61e71fb-08a6-45c7-8ee2-ca0fde209f6c" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-BQMOd cJTQvv pf-71_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-72_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-73_"><p class="sc-zmgRN eaWHaV pf-74_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Compatibility.&nbsp;</b>7.4V batteries can charge our 5V heated apparel, <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mens-heated-jacket-7-4v?_pos=2&amp;_fid=b9bcbdca2&amp;_ss=c" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></span></a><u><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mens-heated-jacket-7-4v?_pos=2&amp;_fid=b9bcbdca2&amp;_ss=c" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"></span></span></a><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mens-heated-jacket-7-4v?_pos=2&amp;_fid=b9bcbdca2&amp;_ss=c" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);">7.4V heated apparel</span></span></a> </u>and other electric devices; 12V batteries can charge our 7.4V heated apparel,<a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/men-s-heated-canvas-work-jacket-12v?_pos=3&amp;_sid=96b5c6b1a&amp;_ss=r" target="_blank"><span style="color: rgb(237, 108, 51);"> 12V heated apparel</span></a>, and other electric devices. (*Remember to plug your apparel into the proper port.)&nbsp;<br> </p><p class="sc-zmgRN eaWHaV pf-76_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Warmth.</b>&nbsp;There are many factors affecting the warmth of heated apparel, including heating settings, heating elements, or clothing fabric. Generally, the battery impacts the heating hours and power output. For example, our Venustas-10000&nbsp;battery allows our 7.4V heated apparel to work up to 20hrs.<br> </p></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-78_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-79_"><div class="sc-eONOlN heXKEz pf-80_ pf-table-default" data-pf-type="Table"><table class="pf-inner-table"><tbody><tr><th class="A1"><span>Specification</span></th><th class="B1"><span>Venustas-6000 Battery</span></th><th class="C1"><span>Venustas-7500 Battery<br></span></th><th class="D1"><span><a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/mini-7-4v-battery-pack-4800mah" target="_blank"></a>Venustas-10000 Battery</span></th></tr><tr><td class="A2"><span>Heating elements</span></td><td class="B2"><span>5-6</span></td><td class="C2"><span>5-6</span></td><td class="D2"><span>5-6</span></td></tr><tr><td class="A3"><span>Compatibility</span></td><td class="B3"><span>5V heated apparel;<br>7.4V heated apparel;<br>other electric devices</span></td><td class="C3"><span>7.4V heated apparel; <br>12V heated apparel; <br>Other electric devices</span></td><td class="D3"><span>7.4V heated apparel; <br>12V heated apparel; <br>Other electric devices</span></td></tr><tr><td class="A4"><span>Power output</span></td><td class="B4"><span>★★★★</span></td><td class="C4"><span>★★★★★</span></td><td class="D4"><span>★★★★★</span></td></tr><tr><td class="A5"><span>Portability</span></td><td class="B5"><span>★★★★★</span></td><td class="C5"><span>★★★★</span></td><td class="D5"><span>★★★★</span></td></tr><tr><td class="A6"><span>Working hours <br>(7.4V heated apparel <br>with 5 heating elements)</span></td><td class="B6"><span>Up to 10hrs</span></td><td class="C6"><span>Up to 13hrs</span></td><td class="D6"><span>Up to 20hrs</span></td></tr><tr><td class="A7"><span>Charging hours</span></td><td class="B7"><span>4 hours with a 15w charger</span></td><td class="C7"><span>2 hours with a 35w charger</span></td><td class="D7"><span>3 hours with a 35w charger</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6a45" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-gplwNw kNhQlQ pf-81_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jlGhtx hdJeUI"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-82_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-83_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eNSrbD dsyRF pf-84_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-86_"><b>Use Your Venustas Battery Pack<br></b></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-87_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-88_"><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-fscnvs ckThdY pf-89_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-90_ pf-text-1"> Make sure the battery is fully charged before first use.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-92_ pf-text-1"> Insert the power cable into the battery port. If there’s output, the battery indicator will be kept on.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-94_ pf-text-1">Charge other electric devices with USB/Type-C port (5V &amp; 7.4V battery: USB port; 12V batteries: Type-C port)</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-96_ pf-text-1">Remove the power cable to turn off the battery within 30s.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-570c" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-gplwNw kNhQlQ pf-98_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jlGhtx hdJeUI"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-99_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-100_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eNSrbD dsyRF pf-101_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-103_"><b>Charge Your Venustas Battery Pack<br></b></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-104_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-105_"><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-fscnvs ckThdY pf-106_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-107_ pf-text-1"><strong>WaII power outlet</strong>. Plug your USB charging cable into a USB power adapter, then plug the adapter into the wall outlet.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-109_ pf-text-1"><strong>Computer</strong>. Plug your charging cable into a USB 2.0 or 3.0 port on a computer that's on and not in sleep mode. Don't use the USB ports on your keyboard.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-111_ pf-text-1"><strong>Power accessory</strong>. Plug your cable into a docking station or other certified accessory.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-de74" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-gplwNw kNhQlQ pf-113_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jlGhtx hdJeUI"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-114_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-115_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eNSrbD dsyRF pf-116_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-118_"><b>Store Your Venustas Battery Pack</b></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-119_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-120_"><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-fscnvs ckThdY pf-121_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-122_ pf-text-1">Check the battery level before storage. Keep the battery level between 20% to 80%.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-124_ pf-text-1">Regularly charge the battery if no longer using it to maintain the performance.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-126_ pf-text-1">Keep the battery away from the moisture. Store the battery pack where the relative humidity is 65±20% RH.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bWJTsT eXIsbe pf-128_ pf-text-1">Don’t expose the battery to extreme temperatures. Store the battery where the temperature is 77±20℉(25±20°C).</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-afc6" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-gplwNw kNhQlQ pf-130_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jlGhtx hdJeUI"><div class="sc-fBWQee eTKFIf pf-131_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fPrdjK cvZVBM pf-132_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-133_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-135_">Believe now you have a clear understanding of 5V battery, 7.4V battery, and 12V battery. If you have any questions about the battery or meet any&nbsp;product problems, please refer to our <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/blogs/news/how-t